# AGENTS.md — Visual Identity Contract ({{ manifest.project_name }})

> **Compact Agent Directive:** Enforce these tokens on every front-end file. Do not use default Tailwind indigo/slate palettes.

## 1. Mandatory Tokens
- **Archetype:** `{{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.aesthetic_archetype }}`
- **Canvas & Surfaces:**
  - Primary BG: `{{ manifest.color_system.background_primary.hex }}` (ink: `{{ manifest.color_system.background_primary.contrast_text_hex }}`)
  - Contrast Band BG: `{{ manifest.color_system.background_secondary.hex }}` (ink: `{{ manifest.color_system.background_secondary.contrast_text_hex }}`)
  - Card Surface: `{{ manifest.color_system.surface_card.hex }}` (ink: `{{ manifest.color_system.surface_card.contrast_text_hex }}`)
- **Ink & Accents:**
  - Text Primary: `{{ manifest.color_system.text_primary.hex }}` | Text Secondary: `{{ manifest.color_system.text_secondary.hex }}`
  - Primary CTA Accent: `{{ manifest.color_system.accent_primary.hex }}` (ink: `{{ manifest.color_system.accent_primary.contrast_text_hex }}`)
  - Supporting Badge Accent: `{{ manifest.color_system.accent_secondary.hex }}` (ink: `{{ manifest.color_system.accent_secondary.contrast_text_hex }}`)
- **Typography:**
  - Display: `'{{ manifest.typography.display_heading.family_recommended }}'` (`{{ manifest.typography.display_heading.weight }}`, `{{ manifest.typography.display_heading.text_transform }}`, tracking `{{ manifest.typography.display_heading.letter_spacing }}`)
  - Section: `'{{ manifest.typography.section_heading.family_recommended }}'` (`{{ manifest.typography.section_heading.weight }}`, `{{ manifest.typography.section_heading.text_transform }}`)
  - Body: `'{{ manifest.typography.body_copy.family_recommended }}'` | Mono: `'{{ manifest.typography.monospace_accent.family_recommended }}'`
  - Import URL: `{{ manifest.typography.google_fonts_import_url }}`
- **Geometry:**
  - Border: `{{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.border_style }}`
  - Shadow: `{{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.shadow_style }}`
  - Radii: `sm={{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.border_radius_tokens.sm }}`, `md={{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.border_radius_tokens.md }}`, `lg={{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.border_radius_tokens.lg }}`, `pill={{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.border_radius_tokens.pill }}`

