- [ ] `tokens.css` variables (or `tailwind.theme.json` tokens) are imported at root.
- [ ] All interactive buttons and cards use `border: {{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.border_style }}` and `box-shadow: {{ manifest.frontend_ui_rules.shadow_style }}`.
